      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Where Temporal fits",
      "items": [
        "Each conversation is a workflow: it waits, retries and survives crashes",
        "Model calls and tool calls are activities, recorded in the history",
        "A restart replays the history: nothing lost, nothing done twice"
      ]
